#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'EOF'
Knowledge Hub Interactive Lab
Terraform: State Drift and Reconciliation

Scenario
  Terraform manages /workspace/managed.txt.
  After the last successful apply, somebody changed that file manually.
  The configuration and state still describe desired-v1.

Goal
  Use Terraform to detect the drift and reconcile the managed resource so:
    - terraform validate succeeds
    - local_file.managed exists in state
    - terraform plan reports no changes
    - managed.txt contains desired-v1

Start here
  terraform version
  cat main.tf
  cat managed.txt
  terraform state show local_file.managed
  terraform plan

Useful commands
  terraform plan
  terraform apply
  terraform state show local_file.managed

Lab commands
  help    show this assignment again
  status  show current file, state and plan
  check   validate state, content and a clean plan
  hint    reveal progressive help
  reset   recreate the out-of-band drift

When finished, run: check
EOF
